This repository packages the dsmcFoam+ sources
(https://igit.iap-kborn.de/staszak/dsmcfoamplus-v2306, branch master,
commit 9c86522) together with patches that make them build and run on
OpenFOAM v2406, plus converted cases, scripts and user function objects.

dsmcFoam+ is a set of advanced features copied from the
OpenFOAM-2.4.0-MNF repository and reworked for OpenFOAM >= v2212.
Copyright: OpenCFD Ltd. / OpenFOAM Foundation (GPL v3), and the dsmcFoam+
authors — see

  C. White et al., 2018, Comput. Phys. Commun. 224, 1-21
      "dsmcFoam+: An OpenFOAM based direct simulation Monte Carlo solver"
  T. Staszak, 2024, Meccanica
      "A statistical boundary for 3D rarefied flows through meshes"

